P     1071102A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HITACHI MAXELL</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KISHIMOTO MIKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HITACHI MAXELL, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KISHIMOTO, MIKIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KISHIMOTO MIKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KISHIMOTO, MIKIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A rare earth-iron-boron type magnetic powder comprising a rare earth element, iron and boron, characterized as having a coercive force of 80 to 400 kA/m, a saturation magnetization of 10 to 25  mu Wb/g, an average particle size in the range of 5 to 200 nm, and a form of from sphere to ellipse; and a magnetic recording medium having a magnetic layer comprising the magnetic powder and a binder. The magnetic recording medium can be used for rendering commercially practical an extra-thin magnetic layer having a thickness of 0.3  mu m or less, which has been difficult to produce commercially in a conventional coating-type recording medium using a magnetic powder of a needle form.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne une poudre magnétique à base de terre rare, de fer et de bore caractérisée par une force coercitive de 80 à 400 kA/m, une saturation magnétique de 10 à 25  mu Wb/g, un calibre particulaire moyen compris entre 5 et 200 nm, et une forme allant de la sphère à l'ellipse. L'invention concerne également un support d'enregistrement magnétique dont la couche magnétique est faite de cette poudre magnétique et d'un liant. Ce support d'enregistrement magnétique permet de réaliser dans des conditions commercialement accessibles une couche magnétique extra-fine d'une épaisseur n'excédant pas 0,3  mu m, production qui était commercialement irréaliste avec les supports d'enregistrement à couche conventionnelle utilisant une poudre magnétique en forme d'aiguille.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>